## Run / Test / Build

```bash
# Install
npm ci

# Dev server
npm run dev          # Express: nodemon; NestJS: nest start --watch

# Test
npm test             # jest
npm run test:e2e     # supertest + real DB

# Build (production)
npm run build        # tsc compile to dist/
npm start            # node dist/main.js (Nest) or dist/app.js (Express)
```

## Known Gotchas

[Service-specific quirks. Examples:]
- **Async middleware error**: any async middleware MUST use `asyncHandler` wrapper or rejections silently 200. See `node-patterns.md §Async Error Handling`.
- **Prisma `select`** drops fields silently; use `tests/scenario_node_p2_select_omission/demo.js` pattern for P2 coverage.
- **NestJS DI scope**: avoid `@Injectable({ scope: Scope.REQUEST })` in financial paths — performance penalty + harder to test.
